# Laid out Medium on a phone on its side (sfdesk frame.mbt's tape): MBUI_WIN=844x390 MBUI_FILM_PLATFORM=2, its size
# classes expanded in width and compact in height, a finger. The same steps as tape.drive: the sidebar's edge tapped
# (it comes over), a chat tapped in it (it comes over), back (the sidebar over again), the chat's edge tapped.
system {"size_class":{"width":"expanded","height":"compact"}}
timeout 20000
until 发消息
wait 1000
tapxy 80 200
wait 1300
tap 首页的列表改成按天分组
wait 1500
back
wait 1300
tapxy -90 200
wait 1300
exit
